WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
my dear mother

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,760
It was just a joke

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,170
Why are you calling so early?

4
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:07,690
You are pretty enough

5
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,370
You also have to make sure you sleep

6
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,690
I just went to buy groceries

7
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:12,290
Met Qingyao’s mother

8
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:17,720
Guess what she told me? Mom, it’s wrong for you to listen to my excuses.

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,520
Just listen to my explanation

10
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,480
Let me see you before noon

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,280
Otherwise, don’t go back to this home again.

12
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:28,820
What's the matter?

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,180
I have to go home today

14
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,100
Maybe I won't come back until tomorrow or the day after tomorrow

15
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:38,900
These two days, you stay in the hotel and watch over Brother Yu for me.

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,140
Why don't you take the fish back with you?
